      "name": "P4 produced minimal ATA grant — all four ATA-2 dimensions stated, status from issuance, Data Integrity proof (authority-producer-ref round-trip)",
      "$comment": "The exact document authority-producer-ref's produceGrant emits for the minimal thin-TC-3 slice: ATA-1 authority to accept terms, all FOUR ATA-2 dimensions present (an absent dimension is refused at issuance, not shipped), caps as decimal-integer base-unit strings, delegable+maxDepth explicit, a Bitstring Status List entry FROM issuance (ATA-3 revocability), VC 2.0 + a Data Integrity proof. Authored from the spec, then produced-then-verified against grant.schema.json.",
